import tests/cadkernel/brep_make/emit.dl
import lib/cadkernel/acis_history_cone.dl

set baseXRadius to maker argument 1
set baseYRadius to maker argument 2
set topRadius to maker argument 3
set height to maker argument 4
set matrix to an empty list of a 64 bit floating-point number
loop index from 0 to 16:
    append (maker argument (index + 5)) to matrix
set rebuilt to the cad history rebuilt cone with base x radius baseXRadius, base y radius baseYRadius, top radius topRadius, height height and transform matrix
emit maker number (rebuilt's failure)
if rebuilt's valid:
    emit maker body (rebuilt's value)
free matrix
